# Kia Picanto five-door hatchback, 2004-2011.
#
# Kia's city car, launched in Britain in 2004: 3,495 mm long, 1,595 mm wide,
# 1,480 mm high, 2,370 mm wheelbase; 1.0-1.1 petrol. A cheap, roomy town car and
# one of the first Korean models to sell strongly on price in Britain.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kia_Picanto
#
# Colours: White, Red, Blue and Silver are documented Kia colours of the period.
#
# Weight: 40 in total (white 14, red 10, blue 9, silver 7).
#
# Speed 150 km/h; comfort 75/443 (line). Classes 0,1.
# Dates: 2004-2011 with a road tail to about 2020.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/kia-picanto.blend. References:
# citycars/references/kia-picanto/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

